==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{m|sla-pro|*pero}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-pro|*péth₂r̥||feather, wing}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*peth₂-||to fly}}. Cognates include Ancient Greek {{term|πτερόν||wing, feather|lang=grc}}, Lithuanian {{term|sparnas|lang=lt||aviation}}, and Old Armenian {{term|թիռ||flight|lang=xcl}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-перо.ogg|audio|lang=ru}}
* {{IPA|[pʲɪˈro]|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|перо́|n||пе́рья}}

# [[feather]]
# [[plume]]
# [[pen]]
# {{context|criminal|_|slang|lang=ru}} [[knife]]

